stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIATED: POST /api/payments<br/>(Idempotency Key Validated)
    
    INITIATED --> PROCESSING: Background Worker Claim<br/>(FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    
    PROCESSING --> SUCCESS: Bank HTTP 200 OK<br/>(Charged = true)
    PROCESSING --> RETRYING: Recoverable Failure (500 / 503)<br/>(Retry Budget Remaining)
    PROCESSING --> UNKNOWN: Ambiguous Client Timeout<br/>(Read Timed Out in Transit)
    PROCESSING --> FAILED: Non-Retryable Client Error<br/>(HTTP 4xx / Invalid Details)
    PROCESSING --> DEAD_LETTERED: Retry Budget Exhausted<br/>(Terminal Failure)

    RETRYING --> PROCESSING: Next Retry Due<br/>(Exponential Backoff + Full Jitter)
    RETRYING --> DEAD_LETTERED: Max Attempts Exceeded<br/>(Default: 4 attempts)

    UNKNOWN --> SUCCESS: Reconciled with Bank<br/>(Status Enquiry: charged == true)
    UNKNOWN --> RETRYING: Reconciled with Bank<br/>(Status Enquiry: charged == false & count == 0)
    UNKNOWN --> FAILED: Reconciled with Bank<br/>(Non-Retryable Gateway Failure)

    SUCCESS --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    DEAD_LETTERED --> [*]

    note right of UNKNOWN
        Held in grace period (default: 6,000ms)
        to allow slow in-flight bank settlement.
        Never retried blindly without status check.
    end note

    note left of RETRYING
        Backoff Delay = random(0, baseDelay * 2^attempt)
        Avoids thundering herd problem
        on bank recovery.
    end note
